nty&rsquo;s 5 grids. October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025 on the middle, September to October came in at 38% of normal, and in 2026 so far May to June came in at 188%. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, at 51% or 52% of normal.</p>"}
